      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This Le City Small handbag from Balenciaga's 2026 Chinese New Year capsule collection reimagines the classic motorcycle bag in a grayish-black washed denim. It features signature design elements like aged metal studs and leather pull-tab zippers, while the entire surface is printed with a gradient fading Balenciaga logo wash — a rebellious take on the festive season.",
